@startuml
component "Achievement & Claim Lifecycle Service" as compachievementservice
component "Hotspot & Influence Analytics Engine" as companalyticsservice
component "API Gateway & Security Controller" as compapigateway
component "Automated Backup & Retention System" as compbackupmanagementsystem
component "Data Collection & ETL Pipeline" as compdataingestionpipeline
component "Secure Hybrid Persistence Layer" as comphybridstorageengine
component "Institution Hierarchy Management Service" as compinstitutionservice
component "Academic Collaboration & Messaging Service" as compinteractionservice
component "Academic Misconduct Detection Service" as compmisconductdetectionservice
component "Multilingual Semantic Search Engine" as compnlpsearchengine
component "Recommendation & Discovery Engine" as comprecommendationservice
component "Conversational Search & Translation Gateway" as compsearchconversationalservice
component "User and Scholar Profile Service" as compusermanagement
compachievementservice --> comphybridstorageengine : Stores and reads achievement classifications, claims, and status records with AES-256 encryption.
compachievementservice --> compmisconductdetectionservice : Triggers plagiarism checks and blacklist validations on claimed or submitted drafts.
companalyticsservice --> comphybridstorageengine : Stores computed metrics and reads aggregated academic records.
compapigateway --> compinteractionservice : Transfers comment submissions, questions, and mutual-verification private messaging sessions.
compapigateway --> compsearchconversationalservice : Directs conversational search queries and filter parameters.
compapigateway --> compusermanagement : Routes user authentication, profile requests, and scholar verification actions.
compdataingestionpipeline --> companalyticsservice : Feeds synchronized and cleaned academic data for hotspot computation and influence scoring.
compdataingestionpipeline --> comphybridstorageengine : Persists structured and unstructured academic data into storage.
comphybridstorageengine --> compbackupmanagementsystem : Supplies database dumps and transaction logs for hourly incremental and daily full backups.
compinteractionservice --> compachievementservice : Verifies literature and achievement bindings for commentary, annotations, and Q&A.
compnlpsearchengine --> comphybridstorageengine : Queries index and unstructured literature corpora for search and filtering.
compsearchconversationalservice --> compnlpsearchengine : Dispatches parsed search terms and conversational contexts for semantic retrieval.
compsearchconversationalservice --> comprecommendationservice : Passes user query patterns to inform cross-disciplinary recommendation diversity rules.
compusermanagement --> compinstitutionservice : Queries and associates scholar profiles with institutional nodes in the hierarchy.
@enduml
